
# --- GOLDEN TEST FIXTURE (added by golden-fixture bake) ---
# resetMode=loadvm : disk is a standalone qcow2, snapshot "golden" holds live RAM+disk.
# Reset a test to the fixture with:
#   python3 /data/vms/streamhost/tiles/winxp/drive.py \
#           /data/vms/streamhost/tiles/winxp/qmp.sock loadvm golden
SH_RESET_MODE=loadvm
SH_GOLDEN_SNAPSHOT=golden
SH_GOLDEN_DISKS=winxp-golden.qcow2
# Fixture: Windows XP Pro SP3 desktop (Bliss, Administrator autologon) with Notepad
# open+focused (empty doc, caret at top-left). Screensaver OFF, monitor/disk/standby
# power-down OFF (powercfg Always On, all timeouts 0), tray clock hidden, caret blink
# quieted (CursorBlinkRate=2000000000), Security Center + Automatic Updates disabled
# (no idle balloons). Two no-input frames 3s apart are byte-identical. See GOLDEN.md.
